<title>USA: CCC buys 25,000 T U.S. HRW wheat for Bosnia.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 25,000 T U.S. HRW wheat for Bosnia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 25,000 tonnes U.S. hard red winter wheat for October 5-31 shipment under the export donation program for  Bosnia.</p>
<p>The wheat was acquired from Continental at $177.64 a tonne, FOB Beaumont, Texas.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305 --</p>
</text>
